source('smallcraft','小型船舶靠泊設施設計資料','UFC4-152-07 Small Craft Berthing Facilities','US Department of Defense via WBDG','https://www.wbdg.org/dod/ufc/ufc-4-152-07','現行官方索引列二〇二六年九月版本，舊站仍列二〇〇九版與二〇一二修訂；本課只用書目範圍，不冒稱全文查核。','Current official index lists September2026; the legacy site still lists2009 with2012 change. Only bibliographic scope is used, without claiming full-text review.','Fresh official search turn216search0 confirms30September2026; open turn216view2 has no readable text.',2026)
